    <section class="hero flow">
      <p class="card-note">Community group · Notices and rules · 2024</p>
      <h1>Meadow Row Allotments</h1>
      <p class="lead">A small site for forty plot holders: rules, a plot map, seasonal notices, and a way to reach the committee.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="prose flow">
      <h2>The brief</h2>
      <p>The allotment committee kept its rules in a folder of photocopies and its notices on a board by the gate. New plot holders often missed both, and the committee changes every few years, so whatever we built had to be easy to hand on.</p>
      <h2>What we built</h2>
      <p>A short site with the rules on one page, a plot map drawn as a simple image, a notices page ordered by season, and a contact page that names the current committee. A one-page guide explains how to change each of them.</p>
      <h2>Since launch</h2>
      <p>The site has already passed to a new committee secretary, who took it over using the written guide alone.</p>
      <p><a href="/#work">Back to all work</a></p>
    </section>
    <section class="section-contact">
      <h2>Need something similar?</h2>
      <p class="body">Tell us what your site needs to do and we will reply within a few days.</p>
      <p class="action"><a href="/about/#contact">Start a project</a></p>
    </section>
